{"key":"eJwVy9EKwyAMQNE\/SmZdbTMYYzDYH\/Rdos4ynMFm+PvFxwvnZlU5boi9d5AatHkGrgVFD2wx7C2yQhGLnJtCKjjEF9\/XmWgakdLOUOLHS66\/OMTztS1uoYnWi7HjffwleI3hbty8Gkfk7AndyCds","enclosureUrl":"https:\/\/www.podtrac.com\/pts\/redirect.mp3\/chrt.fm\/track\/G45992\/traffic.megaphone.fm\/ADV7679298013.mp3?updated=1658169963","enclosureType":"audio\/mpeg","enclosureLen":"0","title_ep":"In Trump's Shadow: Rep. Liz Cheney","description_ep":"Rep. Liz Cheney of Wyoming began the Trump era a rising Republican star. She was elected to the House of Representatives in 2016, the same year Donald Trump was elected president, and quickly advanced in the GOP congressional leadership. It all came crashing down this year, when Cheney rejected Trump, very publicly, after he refused to concede defeat to President Joe Biden and claimed the 2020 election was stolen.\nIn this episode, Cheney discusses the moment\u00a0she concluded Trump should be purged from the Republican Party, why she believes the 45th president is a clear and present danger to the republic, and what she thinks of Republicans, like House Minority Leader Kevin McCarthy of California, who have remained loyal to Trump through all of it.\nLearn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com\/adchoices","pubDate_ep":"Mon, 18 Jul 2022 18:40:06 -0000","author_ep":"The Ricochet Audio Network","guid_ep":{"text":"2d358b9e-06c9-11ed-b96e-33ded1b023f3","isPermaLink":"false"},"duration_ep":"2717","language_ep":null,"epHasPol":true,"polGuestName":"liz cheney","rssKey":2461703,"title_pod":"In Trump's Shadow: The Battle for 2024","description_pod":"In Trump's Shadow: The Battle for 2024 is a weekly interview program with some of the biggest names and political operatives in politics that examines the generational impact former President Donald Trump had, and is still having, on the Republican Party and takes a deep dive into the dramatic race for the GOP presidential nomination in 2024 that is already well underway. In Trump's Shadow; The Battle for 2024 is a companion podcast to the forthcoming by David M. Drucker: In Trump's Shadow; The Battle for 2024 and the Future of the GOP.","lastBuildDate_pod":null,"language_pod":"en","category_pod":null,"keywords_pod":null,"owner_pod":{"{http:\/\/www.itunes.com\/dtds\/podcast-1.0.dtd}name":"The Ricochet Audio Network","{http:\/\/www.itunes.com\/dtds\/podcast-1.0.dtd}email":"production@ricochet.com"},"guid_pod":null,"{http:\/\/www.itunes.com\/dtds\/podcast-1.0.dtd}guid_pod":null,"rssUrl":null,"category1":null,"category2":null,"category3":null,"category4":null,"category5":null,"category6":null,"category7":null,"category8":null,"category9":null,"category10":null,"cleanDates":1658169606000.0,"first_name_exec":null,"middle_name_exec":null,"last_name_exec":null,"numTerms_exec":null,"earliestTerm_exec":null,"latestTerm_exec":null,"earliestParty_exec":null,"latestParty_exec":null,"names_exec":null,"is_exec":null,"numTerms_cong":3.0,"earliestTerm_cong":1483401600000.0,"latestTerm_cong":1672704000000.0,"earliestParty_cong":"Republican","latestParty_cong":"Republican","gender_cong":"F","type_cong":"rep","state_cong":"WY","district_cong":0.0,"party_cong":"Republican","names_cong":"Liz Cheney","is_cong":1.0,"name":"liz cheney","id":81242,"mp3_url":"https:\/\/www.podtrac.com\/pts\/redirect.mp3\/chrt.fm\/track\/G45992\/traffic.megaphone.fm\/ADV7679298013.mp3?updated=1658169963","nSpeakers":2,"overSpeakers":["SPEAKER_04","SPEAKER_02"],"underSpeakers":["SPEAKER_03","SPEAKER_01","SPEAKER_00"],"inferredHost":"SPEAKER_04","inferredGuest":"SPEAKER_02"}
